Optional hardening:

- Add a CI rule that statically checks every `@RequestMapping` under `JobLogController` (and ideally across all controllers) calls `validJobGroupPermission` when its handler touches a `jobGroup` / `logId` / `jobId` parameter.
- Consider moving tenant enforcement into a method-level `@PreAuthorize` rather than per-handler ad-hoc checks, so omissions like this one surface at compile time.

