# Summary
A SSRF vulnerability was discovered at /jobinfo/trigger in latest version of xxl-job. The target URI parameter for network requests is user-controllable and lacks sufficient security processing, resulting in an SSRF vulnerability that allows attackers to exploit this flaw to probe and exploit internal services of the target system.

